801","priority":5,"questId":73528,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":735280101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30406,"speakerName":"バシマ","textMapHash":3857589410,"text":"そこのあなたさま、生論派学者であるこのバシマがあなたさまにお願いいたします。どうかそう急いで離れようとなさらず…","nextNodeIds":[735280102]},{"nodeId":735280102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30406,"speakerName":"バシマ","textMapHash":2204034530,"text":"肩の力を抜き、頭を空っぽにして、わたくしの言葉に耳をお貸しくださいませ——","nextNodeIds":[735280103]},{"nodeId":735280103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30406,"speakerName":"バシマ","textMapHash":3267747234,"text":"ヤマガラが一番可愛い！！！","nextNodeIds":[735280104]},{"nodeId":735280104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3674159522,"text":"？","nextNodeIds":[735280105]},{"nodeId":735280105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2630273882,"text":"？","nextNodeIds":[735280106]},{"nodeId":735280106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1978343922,"text":"ヤマガラは確かに可愛いけど、バシマは学者なんだよな？根拠もなしにそんなこと言って、激しい議論になったりしないのか？","nextNodeIds":[735280107]},{"nodeId":735280107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2728465146,"text":"オイラの印象じゃ、学者はみんな発言には慎重だよな。もしオイラが学者なら、軽い気持ちで…ええと…「エビのポテト包み揚げが一番美味しい！」なんて、絶対に言える気がしないぞ！","nextNodeIds":[735280108]},{"nodeId":735280108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2367191490,"text":"なにか、こう、前提を加えないとだろ。例えば「最近の璃月料理の中だと、オイラはこの料理が一番食べたい」とか。","nextNodeIds":[735280109,735280110,735280111]},{"nodeId":735280109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":696545178,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}は言える！！！","nextNodeIds":[735280112]},{"nodeId":735280112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":503328322,"text":"#うわぁ！{NICKNAME}、突然どうしたんだよ！","nextNodeIds":[735280113]},{"nodeId":735280113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1041592482,"text":"本気で言ってるんだとしても、そんな大声で言わなくてもいいだろ…","nextNodeIds":[735280114]},{"nodeId":735280114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30406,"speakerName":"バシマ","textMapHash":1633768138,"text":"おほほほ！ええ、まさにそういうことでございます！","nextNodeIds":[735280115]},{"nodeId":735280115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30406,"speakerName":"バシマ","textMapHash":397967930,"text":"学者だからこそ、日常生活の一分一秒を全て議論の場にしたり、一言たりとも間違わないように気をつけたりなんてごめんですの。","nextNodeIds":[735280116]},{"nodeId":735280116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30406,"speakerName":"バシマ","textMapHash":1690719914,"text":"どうせわたくしを四六時中見張っている人なんていませんから、一言くらい不用意に言葉を発しても、減るものではございません。そこまでびくびくする必要なんてないのですわ！","nextNodeIds":[735280117]},{"nodeId":735280117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30406,"speakerName":"バシマ","textMapHash":3432790570,"text":"ですが、一番大切な思いは、絶対に大きな声で叫び、大胆に打ち明けていくべきございます。","nextNodeIds":[735280118]},{"nodeId":735280118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30406,"speakerName":"バシマ","textMapHash":3440570922,"text":"もし、あなたさまがたもこのテーブルゲーム「カラコロ！チュンボール」を遊んだことがおありでしたら、必ずわたくしと同じように、ヤマガラが一番かわいい！と、叫びたくなるはずですわ！","nextNodeIds":[735280119]},{"nodeId":735280119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4109032274,"text":"カラ…コロ…チュンボール？後ろのテーブルにあるやつのことか？","nextNodeIds":[735280120]},{"nodeId":735280120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30406,"speakerName":"バシマ","textMapHash":1308233562,"text":"そうですわ。このゲームを遊んでいただければ、心の底からヤマガラの可愛さに開眼されることでしょう！","nextNodeIds":[735280121]},{"nodeId":735280121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30406,"speakerName":"バシマ","textMapHash":3062816666,"text":"しかも、これは「ヴェルーリヤ·ミラージュ」の正式なアトラクションの一つですから、ゲームでハイスコアを取れた場合は、報酬もありますわ！","nextNodeIds":[735280122]},{"nodeId":735280122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3548678906,"text":"そこまで言われると、ちょっと気になってきちゃったぞ。しかも上手ければ、報酬もあるんだろ…","nextNodeIds":[735280123]},{"nodeId":735280123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3681989258,"text":"#{NICKNAME}はどう思う？","nextNodeIds":[735280124,735280125]},{"nodeId":735280124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2606038834,"text":"やってみよう！","nextNodeIds":[735280126]},{"nodeId":735280126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30406,"speakerName":"バシマ","textMapHash":1700229946,"text":"おほほほ！思い切りが良うございますわね！ではどうぞ、ご存分にお楽しみくださいませ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":735280125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2096824570,"text":"ヤマガラの可愛さがどれほどのものか！","nextNodeIds":[735280126]},{"nodeId":735280110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1947857394,"text":"パイモンが一番可愛い！！！","nextNodeIds":[735280112]},{"nodeId":735280111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":443174962,"text":"以上！！！","nextNodeIds":[735280112]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7352801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30406"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":10,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7352801],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30406,"speakerName":"バシマ","count":11},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":9},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":6}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[173528],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":589882150,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EP